  "decision": "NO_CHANGE",
  "workflow_yaml": null,
  "rationale": "The workflow already applies the dependency-caching optimization (P-LIT-GHA-CACHE): every job (lint, test, diagrams) uses astral-sh/setup-uv@v8.2.0 with enable-cache: true and cache-dependency-glob: \"uv.lock\", keying the uv dependency cache on the lockfile, which is the Python/uv equivalent of the evidenced actions/cache dependency-download pattern. Other candidate optimizations lack verified preconditions: P-LIT-CUSTOM-TIMEOUT requires representative successful-duration history, but ci_history reports no completed runs / not a measured baseline, and a timeout could break valid slow runs; P-LIT-FAIL-FAST needs a matrix (none exists); P-LIT-CANCEL-STALE needs superseded-run cancellation semantics (none configured); P-LIT-SKIP-WORKFLOW and P-LIT-CHANGE-FILTER require repository policy/required-status verification that is not established (required_checks status is not_verified). No supported, prerequisite-checked change is available without weakening coverage or adding unverified behavior.",
  "evidence_ids": ["P-LIT-GHA-CACHE", "P-LIT-CUSTOM-TIMEOUT"]
}
